# General

- TypeScript strict; prefer small pure modules and explicit ports over hidden coupling.
- Root CI bar: `format:check` + `lint` + `build` + `typecheck` + `test:run` (`typecheck` after `build` so workspace `@balloons/*` resolve via `dist`). Editor `tsconfig.json` includes tests (`noEmit`); emit via `tsconfig.build.json`. Agent must run Prettier write on touched files — see `format.mdc`.
- New/changed behavior requires tests in the same change — see `tests.mdc`.
- Do not introduce Mongo, real scrape networks, or prod deploy wiring before the roadmap phase allows it.
- Match existing file layout and naming; avoid drive-by refactors unrelated to the task.
- Comments only for non-obvious intent; no narrating what the code already says.
